# Settings for smartclock-exporter.  Each line matches a command line
# option of the same name; `smartclock-exporter --help` documents them.

# Where to serve /metrics.  Localhost by default: a reading says where
# the receiver is to within a few metres, so widening this is a decision
# to take rather than a default to accept.  Prometheus scraping from
# another host needs 0.0.0.0:9979 here and a firewall that agrees.
#SMARTCLOCK_EXPORTER_LISTEN=127.0.0.1:9979

# The daemon's socket.
#SMARTCLOCK_EXPORTER_SOCKET=/run/smartclockd/socket
